--- Overview
Updates tartvm to use the field name vmspool.VMResources.Cores, which replaces NumCores.

--- Key Changes
  * tartvm/provider.go
    * Provider.Get now fills in Cores from the VM's CPU value.
    * resourcesConfigured and resourceFlags now read Cores when deciding on the --cpu flag for tart set and rendering it.
  * tartvm/tart_clone_test.go
    * testResources now sets Cores.

--- Breaking Changes
None in tartvm. The breaking change is the NumCores -> Cores rename in vmspool.VMResources, and this PR keeps tartvm building against it.
